    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/bf74b9c4227378020fb764f1a197c2a4.avif?t=1754533415\" width=616 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world of <strong>chaos and conquest</strong> in <i>Soul Tides</i>, a <strong>fast-paced multiplayer auto-battler</strong> where strategy is everything. Command <strong>fallen warriors, cursed beasts, and arcane horrors</strong> as you battle to regain the favor of the dark lord. Master the art of <strong>summoning, resource management, and unit customization</strong> in this <strong>fantasy tug-of-war showdown!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Features \u2694\ufe0f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Build &amp; Expand</strong> \u2013 Construct Shrines and fortifications to unlock powerful <strong>Blessings and units</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/c38fc2b19d806ff5a0bd2752b9a1e750.avif?t=1754533415\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Customize Your Army</strong> \u2013 Research and assign <strong>unique abilities</strong> to your minions, creating devastating synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Pray for Power</strong> \u2013 Offer <strong>Gold and Souls\u00a0</strong>in tribute to the dark lord. If you are deemed worthy, you\u2019ll unlock new <strong>units and abilities</strong> to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/39e48746e03ee73de12f46d530f4d23c.avif?t=1754533415\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2696\ufe0f <strong>Tug-of-War Combat</strong> \u2013 Deploy minions that <strong>fight automatically</strong>, pushing the frontlines toward your enemy\u2019s stronghold in a relentless battle for control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/1af5bcc11d29a80d328187bef818459d.avif?t=1754533415\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Deep Tech Tree</strong> \u2013 Unlock new strategies with a <strong>dynamic research system</strong> that ensures no two matches play out the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong> \u2013 Challenge friends and rivals in <strong>intense PvP battles</strong>, where strategy and adaptation are the keys to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Balance <strong>Gold, Supply, and Souls\u00a0</strong>to maintain an army capable of overwhelming your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/311dfba66a3d5828c3fa9da2df9c4388.avif?t=1754533415\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Dark Fantasy Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a world of <strong>forbidden magic, demonic bargains, and relentless warfare</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you rise once more, or be cast into oblivion?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for battle. <strong>Claim your power.</strong> Rule the battlefield.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/bf74b9c4227378020fb764f1a197c2a4.avif?t=1754533415\" width=616 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world of <strong>chaos and conquest</strong> in <i>Soul Tides</i>, a <strong>fast-paced multiplayer auto-battler</strong> where strategy is everything. Command <strong>fallen warriors, cursed beasts, and arcane horrors</strong> as you battle to regain the favor of the dark lord. Master the art of <strong>summoning, resource management, and unit customization</strong> in this <strong>fantasy tug-of-war showdown!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Features \u2694\ufe0f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Build &amp; Expand</strong> \u2013 Construct Shrines and fortifications to unlock powerful <strong>Blessings and units</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/c38fc2b19d806ff5a0bd2752b9a1e750.avif?t=1754533415\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Customize Your Army</strong> \u2013 Research and assign <strong>unique abilities</strong> to your minions, creating devastating synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Pray for Power</strong> \u2013 Offer <strong>Gold and Souls\u00a0</strong>in tribute to the dark lord. If you are deemed worthy, you\u2019ll unlock new <strong>units and abilities</strong> to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/39e48746e03ee73de12f46d530f4d23c.avif?t=1754533415\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2696\ufe0f <strong>Tug-of-War Combat</strong> \u2013 Deploy minions that <strong>fight automatically</strong>, pushing the frontlines toward your enemy\u2019s stronghold in a relentless battle for control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/1af5bcc11d29a80d328187bef818459d.avif?t=1754533415\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Deep Tech Tree</strong> \u2013 Unlock new strategies with a <strong>dynamic research system</strong> that ensures no two matches play out the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong> \u2013 Challenge friends and rivals in <strong>intense PvP battles</strong>, where strategy and adaptation are the keys to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Balance <strong>Gold, Supply, and Souls\u00a0</strong>to maintain an army capable of overwhelming your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/311dfba66a3d5828c3fa9da2df9c4388.avif?t=1754533415\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Dark Fantasy Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a world of <strong>forbidden magic, demonic bargains, and relentless warfare</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you rise once more, or be cast into oblivion?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for battle. <strong>Claim your power.</strong> Rule the battlefield.</p>",
